  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，{F1 81}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7C 03}对、对不起哦？\n本来想好好休息一下，\n但果然还是放心不下……就过来了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}结果发现大家都在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0D 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0E 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}简直高耸入云。\n连同这片天空，\n都笼罩着极为不祥的气息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 09}已经不只是时钟塔了。\n而是巨大的阴影集合体……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}玲……\n真想快点救她出来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}我也一样，但必须谨慎。\n要是救人不成，反而把自己也搭进去，\n那就无法挽回了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0F 01 05 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就是啊。\n如果大家倒下了，\n又有谁能救玲呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯……越是现在，越要冷静……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0A 01 08 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}小玲……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 00 05}别哭啊，小熊。\n不是已经决定要救她了吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们也不可能就这么丢下她回去。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 71 0B}当然！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D6 07}救她……吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们究竟能为玲做些什么呢……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯……\n刚才听了善的话，\n我也有点这样的感觉。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_180.bf.json:15:1",
